# Help
L_HELP_TITLE="Help"
L_HELP_BODY="ResPinGuy
Create an ISO image of your Linux system.

INTERFACE
  respinguy               This menu
  respinguy --build       Direct build
  respinguy --config      Direct configuration
  respinguy --deps        Dependency check

COMMANDS
  respinguy-build         Create the ISO image
  respinguy-config        Edit the configuration
  respinguy-app-dep       Check dependencies
  respinguy-app-dep-force-install
                          Install missing dependencies
  respinguy-app-up        Update ResPinGuy
  respinguy-app-rm        Remove ResPinGuy
  respinguy-install       Install the system (live only)

FILES
  /usr/share/ResPinGuy-File-Config/respinguy-config
                          Default configuration
  /usr/share/ResPinGuy-File-Config/respinguy-config.local
                          Settings saved by the interface

DOCUMENTATION
  https://github.com/France-OPG/ResPinGuy

ENVIRONMENT
  RPG_UI_ENGINE=basic     Force the text menu (live resize)
  RPG_FORCE_COLOR=1       Force ANSI colors in the text menu
  NO_COLOR=1              Disable colors
  RPG_NO_MOUSE=1          Disable the mouse in the text menu

ResPinGuy Official [r]"

L_USAGE="Usage: respinguy [--build|--config|--deps|--lang|--help]"
